<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Hang Seng index.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Hang Seng index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs has issued American-style call and put warrants, in six tranches, on the Hang Seng index.</p>
<p>The four tranches of call warrants have up to 2.0 million warrants per tranche and the two tranches of put warrants have up to 750,000 warrants per tranche.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	23.OCT.98		 PAYDATE	04.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, STUTT, DUSS    MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  15,700	 HK$/DEM =4.325</p>
<p>* *  * * * *</p>
<p>		    STRIKE	ISSUE	 PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p>CALL A	    13,000	8.86 DEM    7.21 PCT     4.10 X</p>
<p>CALL B	    15,000	5.92 DEM    11.85 PCT    6.13 X</p>
<p>CALL C	    17,000	3.82 DEM    18.80 PCT    9.50 X</p>
<p>CALL D	    19,000	2.34 DEM    27.46 PCT    15.51 X</p>
<p>PUT E	     13,000	1.49 DEM    21.30 PCT    24.31 X</p>
<p>PUT F	     15,000	2.82 DEM    12.23 PCT    12.84 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
